>That was a very neat trick in 3.0. Unfortunately (but justly :-) in 3.1
>^T eats power as well... 

In 3.1.3, there are three ways to be able to teleport at will with ^T:
 1) You know the teleport away spell, and can invoke it
 2) You are polymorphed into a monster which can teleport
 3) You are at least at Exp level 12 (8 for wizards), AND you have the
    teleport intrinsic.

In previous versions, I think you could always teleport if you were at
level 12 (8 for wizards) or more.  Now this is no longer true: you also
need the teleport intrinsic.

So there's another use for the intrinsic.
